---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, CONTACT, BUSINESS } from '../lib/config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — SK Immigration Services"
  description="Privacy Policy for SK Immigration Services (SMC-Private) Limited, CUIN 0304985. How we collect, use, and protect your personal data."
  canonicalUrl={`${SITE.url}/privacy/`}
>
  <section class="bg-navy-900 py-12">
    <div class="container-sk text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400 text-sm">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-white dark:bg-navy-900">
    <div class="container-sk">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto content-prose">
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 p-5 mb-8">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
            This Privacy Policy applies to <strong>SK Immigration Services (SMC-Private) Limited</strong> (CUIN {BUSINESS.cuin}),
            operating the website <strong>{SITE.url}</strong>. By using our website or services, you agree to this policy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide directly, including:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name, phone number, email address submitted via our contact form or WhatsApp</li>
          <li>Immigration-related information you share during consultations (education, nationality, finances)</li>
          <li>Technical data automatically collected (IP address, browser type, pages visited) via Google Analytics (GA4)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your consultation enquiries and provide immigration guidance</li>
          <li>To prepare and process your immigration file (if you engage our services)</li>
          <li>To send service-related communications you have requested</li>
          <li>To improve our website and understand how visitors use it (analytics)</li>
          <li>To comply with applicable laws and regulations in Pakistan</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Google Analytics & Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) with anonymised IP addresses. We also display Google AdSense advertisements.
          For visitors in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland, analytics and advertising cookies are <strong>denied by default</strong>
          until consent is given (Google Consent Mode v2). You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking at
          <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal data. We may share information only:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>With embassies, VFS Global, or government authorities as required to process your immigration file (with your consent)</li>
          <li>With Google (Analytics and AdSense) under their privacy policies</li>
          <li>If required by Pakistani law or court order</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain client file data for up to 5 years after service completion to comply with Pakistani corporate record-keeping requirements.
          Website analytics data is retained for 26 months (GA4 default).
        </p>

        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You may request access to, correction, or deletion of your personal data by contacting us at
          <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a> or WhatsApp <a href={`tel:${CONTACT.phone}`}>{CONTACT.phoneFormatted}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your data. Our website is served over HTTPS.
          WhatsApp communications are end-to-end encrypted.
        </p>

        <h2>8. External Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our guides link to official embassy websites and government portals. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external sites.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be noted with a new "Last updated" date at the top of this page.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy enquiries: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a><br />
          Office: {CONTACT.address.full}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
